231.     ///
232.     /// # Description
233.     ///
234.     /// Books a frame so that it will not be handed out by [`alloc`].
235.     ///
236.     /// # Parameters
237.     ///
238.     /// - `phys_addr`: Physical address of the frame to book.
239.     ///
240.     /// # Returns
241.     ///
242.     /// Upon success, `Ok(())` is returned. Upon failure, an error is returned instead.
243.     ///
